s off on Monday, 19 October, at 7 pm (UTC+2). Enter the world of Silberheim and prepare for release while earning a very special collectable: the “Driftwood Trader of the West Harbor” promo card. Silberheim will remember this achievement: the card wil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:51:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601830-1846651706684805","game_id":"steam-3601830","kind":"announcement","title":"Silberheim Evolving Card Game Roadmap","summary":"With less than two weeks to go until Silberheim ECG’s big Steam release, it’s time to share our roadmap with you. Of course, release day won’t mark the end of development – it will kick off the next chapter. True to the name of our Evolving Card Game, your cards will continue to evolve, and so will the entire world and the game itself.We’ve spent a long time working on these plans, taking your feedback into account and turning it into carefully considered next steps. And here’s what we’ve come u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T15:23:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684805","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601830-1845383656376682","game_id":"steam-3601830","kind":"announcement","title":"Silberheim ECG Playtest","summary":"Silberheim Evolving Card Game launches on October 30! After years of hard work, one final technical rehearsal awaits: On October 2 and 3, you can put our servers to the test. Sign up directly through the Silberheim ECG Steam page.How to join the stress testIn true Silberheim fashion, we kick off on Friday afternoon at 3:51 PM CET. Request access on our Steam page and jump into the game!When? October 2–3, starting Friday at 3:51 PM CETSign up? Directly through the Silberheim ECG Steam pageMore in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T08:04:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376682","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601830-1839041357035906","game_id":"steam-3601830","kind":"announcement","title":"Exclusive Preview: A Selection of New Artworks","summary":"A collectible card game like Silberheim ECG lives and breathes through its cards and the illustrations that bring them to life. And because we remain committed to the value of handcrafted artwork, we intend to replace all AI placeholders for the release version – a project we previously discussed in greater detail in an article on the Silberheim website. Here, we would like to introduce you to a selection of new artworks created since the beta began. By the way: For a few more days, the Silberhe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T15:04:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357035906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601830-1834602721197182","game_id":"steam-3601830","kind":"announcement","title":"Silberheim ECG at the German Indie Showcase at Summer Game Fest","summary":"This year’s Summer Game Fest took place from June 5–8. For the first time, the German Indie Showcase was also part of the event—including Silberheim Evolving Card Game! We had the great honor of presenting our next major content update there for the first time. We’re happy to explain what it’s all about here.If you’d like to try out Silberheim ECG for yourself, you can register for free on the Silberheim website and download the beta-version oft he game directly. You’ll be the first to hear all ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T21:59:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721197182","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3601830-1827626365768129","game_id":"steam-3601830","kind":"announcement","title":"The Silberheim ECG Beta launches on 27 March","summary":"Dear soul,it’s time to prove yourself in Silberheim!As part of a two-week beta test, we’re putting our evolving card game Silberheim through its paces. Take this chance to get a sneak peek at the game before its release and give us your unfiltered thoughts. Taking part is completely free – because we benefit most from any bugs you find and the feedback you provide.It all kicks off on Friday, 27 March at 3:51 pm. You can register in advance via our Silberheim website. Join our Discord server so y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-25T13:35:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365768129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3601830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3601830":"2026-10-26T10:40:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3601830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:02Z"},"5242830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:0